# Coach Dashboard Tab Sync

Adding or removing a tab from `CoachDashboardScreenV2` requires changes in **5 locations** within `updated_screens.dart`. Missing any one causes an index-out-of-range crash.

## 5 Sync Points

| # | Location | What to update |
|---|----------|---------------|
| 1 | `TabController(length: N)` in `initState()` | Increment/decrement N |
| 2 | `_tabLabels` static const list | Add/remove label string |
| 3 | `_tabIcons` static const list | Add/remove icon |
| 4 | Desktop `TabBar` → `tabs:` list | Add/remove `Tab(icon:, text:)` |
| 5 | `TabBarView` → `children:` list | Add/remove `_buildXxxTab()` widget |

## Current Tabs (8)

CLIENTS, SCHEDULE, INSIGHTS, BRIEFINGS, DOJO, CLASSROOM, TRAINING, FINANCIALS

## Rules

- **Tab order matters** — mobile dropdown menu renders from `_tabLabels` array index
- **New tabs go before FINANCIALS** — FINANCIALS should always be the last tab
- **Each tab needs a `_buildXxxTab()` method** — the TabBarView child must be a widget method, not inline
- **Mobile uses `NeverScrollableScrollPhysics`** — tab switching on mobile is via the dropdown only, not swipe
